WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.547
Welcome to AroNexa for pharmacies. Here's a quick look around.

00:04.547 --> 00:12.528
Today shows new requests, quotes waiting, orders to pack and deliveries. Needs your attention lists what to do first.

00:12.528 --> 00:19.229
Requests brings in prescriptions from doctors, patients and WhatsApp. Open one to prepare a quote.

00:19.229 --> 00:26.144
Check each medicine, set the prices, and press Send quote. The patient can compare it with other pharmacies.

00:26.144 --> 00:33.165
If a medicine is out of stock, suggest a substitute. Your pharmacist checks it, and the doctor approves it.

00:33.165 --> 00:37.285
Orders follows each one from packing to delivery or pickup.

00:37.285 --> 00:43.581
The counter is for walk-in customers. Search or scan a medicine, and make a bill in seconds.

00:43.581 --> 00:50.240
Stock warns you about low, expiring and out of stock medicines, and lets you ask dealers for quotes.

00:50.240 --> 00:56.515
Reports, billing and settings are in the tabs at the top. That's it. Now, start exploring.
